endnote: "Here I am! I stand at the door and knock."
endref: Revelation 3:20

@0:00-0:02 black cue:drone,0.6
sfx: riser
@0:02-0:09 img:redsea ken:push hit:2
vo: Walls of water. An army behind. Nowhere to run.
vo: "The Lord will fight for you. You need only to be still."
ref: Exodus 14:14
@0:09-0:13 img:redsea ken:out cue:tense,0.6
title: He always has.
@0:13-0:15 drop:"The light shines in the darkness" ref:"John 1:5"
@0:15-0:21 img:child ken:up grade:dawn cue:wonder,0.9
vo: Before anything was made, there was love.
@0:21-0:26 img:steps ken:down fx:flare grade:dawn
vo: Not a little. Not enough.
+2 title: Overflowing
@0:26-0:32 img:turn ken:in grade:dawn
vo: For the lost. For the misguided.
vo: For the ones who would wound Him.
@0:32-0:36 img:smile ken:still hold:silent grade:dawn
@0:36-0:42 img:hands ken:slow fx:dove grade:dawn cue:wonder,1
vo: Nothing you do to the body can touch what He holds.
@0:42-0:48 img:kneel ken:in cue:tense,0.8
vo: "Whoever causes one of these little ones to stumble..."
ref: Matthew 18:6
@0:48-0:53 img:millstone ken:down
vo: "...better for them to be drowned in the depths of the sea."
@0:53-0:59 img:door ken:push cue:tense,1
vo: "Not everyone who says 'Lord, Lord'... I never knew you."
ref: Matthew 7:21–23
@0:59-1:01 drop:"The truth will set you free" ref:"John 8:32"
@1:01-1:05 img:temple ken:right cue:build
text: Do not bargain with darkness.
@1:05-1:09 img:take ken:in
text: Drive it out.
@1:09-1:13 cuts:cords,knot,knot!,eyes,braid,whip cue:war
text: He made a whip of cords.
ref: John 2:15
@1:13-1:18 img:tables ken:slow hit:2
vo: "...and drove them all out of His Father's house."
@1:18-1:23 img:doves ken:up fx:flare cue:choir
text: We do not fight people.
text: We fight for them.
@1:23-1:27 img:whipfloor ken:still cue:choir,0.6
title: Love is not weak.
@1:27-1:29 drop:"Take heart. I have overcome the world." ref:"John 16:33"
@1:29-1:36 img:weep ken:slow cue:weep
vo: He wept over the city,
vo: because it did not recognize the time of God's coming.
ref: Luke 19:41–44
@1:36-1:38 img:stone ken:push hit:2
@1:38-1:43 img:ruins ken:left
vo: "Not one stone will be left on another."
ref: Matthew 24:2 · 70 AD
@1:43-1:47 img:redsea ken:in cue:drone,0.7
vo: The sea still parts.
@1:47-2:00 img:grown ken:in cue:heart
text: I will not fear.
text: Fear makes the soul small.
text: Let it come. / Let it pass through me.
text: Only He remains.
@2:00-2:03 img:eyesopen ken:still hold:silent
@2:03-2:10 img:stand ken:up fx:rise cue:tutti grade:dawn
vo: "Do not fear, for I am with you...
vo: I will uphold you with my righteous right hand."
ref: Isaiah 41:10
@2:10-2:13 img:dawn ken:push hit:2 grade:dawn
title: So stand.
@2:13-2:18 img:opendoor ken:in fade cue:outro grade:dawn
text: You were never forced.
text: You were invited.
@2:18-2:23 black
title: Do not be afraid.
